{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8eec8b697540c4bdc6ff873e6799b659bd3844a6c6bfa454c6a4e0efeed82bfa", "ja": "（あ、青羽さん、いたいた！　用事があるって\nいうから、事務室で待ってたんだけど……）", "zh": "（啊，青羽小姐，找到了！她说有事，所以我在办公室等着，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "7a8742f0d6a24014a6211d19b38d8d8240ba3705ae9e2135820df2caaef35dd4", "ja": "ふせんメモを冷蔵庫に貼ってあげたり、\n朝教えてあげたりするのがいいかな……。", "zh": "要不要给她在冰箱上贴张便签，或者早上提醒她一下呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "af6e881ff798a4857aee1b588683c2a2e4285050cfa46e401288300e639a026c", "ja": "ええと……青羽さん？\nすみません、なんだか忙しそうですけど。", "zh": "那个……青羽小姐？\n不好意思，您好像有点忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "b669c789f02554f8154d0eb1bc17b0d2c41850be7221abebb0f1d753e668debc", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです。なにかあったんですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了。有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6d505be44d537fbf4032fe3ec9ec43ff8ce7df843465847e58f3e0da1f0211c9", "ja": "何か、というか……青羽さんに呼ばれていたので。\n用事ってなんでした？", "zh": "该说有什么事嘛……是青羽小姐叫我过来的。\n找我有什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "e83cbe329275d5f41e4f93858baa238e1e33c80335d452f3b111f24422647d4d", "ja": "？　……ああっ！！　そ、そうでした！\n社長さんがお呼びなんです！", "zh": "？……啊！！对、对了！社长在叫您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "566ea7f7d18a8e595257d270bd8ecce298572afcd255fac8ae87c781e4a735a1", "ja": "なんでも、新ユニットのお話だそうで。\nそのための資料をお渡しする予定だったんですけど。", "zh": "听说是要谈新组合的事。\n本来是打算把相关资料交给您的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f53f18482a4eb500f2b5cd95ef76010b2833893d212a952c4cddce5f69fa46db", "ja": "おお！　じゃあ事務所に行った方がいいですね。\n連絡ありがとうございます。", "zh": "哦！那我还是去事务所比较好。\n谢谢您联系我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "2f79e0b6703c5cd94615c7097ec867f10c35c74e0736e226ee24f9612b811d22", "ja": "そんな！　私ったらすっかりお待たせして\nしまったみたいで……ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "不会吧！我好像让您等了很久……对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6b54ab5a892492f58746fc7298071b3c79496ab8b7cf98efc4b06bf80f5fb032", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ。誰だってうっかりはありますし。\n仕事はフォローし合ってこそですからね。", "zh": "没事的。谁都会有疏忽的时候嘛。\n工作本来就该互相照应呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "910d3e7c156881fd26db8821d9114637edfb5529f19f3596aeddc9098efb77fb", "ja": "{$P$}さん……♪\nはい、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "{$P$}先生……♪\n好的，谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "70b38635734dfd524ea19e47af44bc7aad0e0e6ee87edc48f5a51b915935761f", "ja": "これからは私もふせんメモを活用して\n再発防止を……じゃなくって！", "zh": "今后我也会好好利用便签备忘录，防止类似问题再次发生……不对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "9b2e616fae09113071655dc2d4625dff3971e19519fb3c32e077fa73b2f1e226", "ja": "今すぐに資料をお持ちしますから、\nちょっと待っていてくださいね！", "zh": "我马上把资料拿过来，请稍等一下哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1014_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "4e272234f10d3a45ef72eb46b5cc64c1736526952f3330d6553e3f1db732e6ee", "ja": "社長、音無さん、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "社长、音无小姐，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "a956141c9701982d5cd16736cd65dea0636c71d90983fda37869164525ad2564", "ja": "おお、待っていたよ！　すぐにハンコを……。\nってなんだ、君か。いや、君の事も待っていたが……。", "zh": "哦，等你很久了！我马上就来盖章……  \n咦，怎么是你。不，我也在等你，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "8a4222156fe3b1fbc914e5ce7377fdb5bb6c72f1f8727da56aea82c6b96f7765", "ja": "なんだって……どうしたんですか？", "zh": "什么……这是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1018_101kot", "source_sha256": "086d90946f996d94382fab0c6c63c37a8cc8ea6c181f3801fec9ddaf59d23d89", "ja": "今日、届く予定のものがあるんです。\nそれで社長、朝からずっと落ち着かないんですよ。", "zh": "今天有样东西预计会送到。\n所以社长从早上开始就一直坐立不安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "336215739ec4612b2453a191a3aca4768ee4f4a81d3cc9596ff0fa563917e17b", "ja": "そうなんだよ。ソワソワしてしまってね。\n会議にどうしても必要なものなんだ。", "zh": "就是这样。我总觉得坐立不安。\n这是会议上无论如何都需要的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6b4f7b6581e1861a5b51c62e92b32f918ea2fed0b24da829fa2c28eae9bc0bfb", "ja": "今日の会議にですか？　それって、まさか……！", "zh": "是今天的会议要用吗？难道说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1021_haitatsuin", "source_sha256": "0462e8b021137466a9818a3a03b9785b35f77e35c3397cd735a65552d9ba5469", "ja": "ちわー！　お届け物でーす！", "zh": "你好——！有您的快递！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "dc13a480076742508ab7bfd3a5182a416344efd3eb23324fe1a578d7f391478d", "ja": "おおっ、ようやく来たね！　いやぁ、ご苦労さん。\nハンコは用意してあるよ～。", "zh": "哦哦，终于来了！哎呀，辛苦啦。\n印章已经准备好了哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "337c4cee84b2900075d9d9a1b2ddc5257cafd1314f5e452a0bdfb2dbc02974ee", "ja": "やっと届きましたね、観里音屋のお茶菓子。\nこれ美味しいんですよね～♪", "zh": "终于送来了呢，観里音屋的茶点。这个很好吃的呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "793309c5dfddd8715a44b91278827b6b8f65e71d69f40b6e8cb5489951ed767e", "ja": "ええっ！？　お茶菓子だったんですか。\n俺はてっきり、新曲が届いたのかと……。", "zh": "诶！？原来是茶点啊。\n我还以为是新歌送到了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "b1ea0502cfd3cebda2cc792a993ba9892247fd43dea50f1a4c4dcc2cfd6da5a0", "ja": "はっはっは、もちろん新曲も用意してあるよ。\n早速だが、ぜひ聴いてくれたまえ！", "zh": "哈哈哈，当然也准备了新歌。事不宜迟，务必听听看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "f00b9276fbc047732bb6b70746f036f452f7e8a07be795145924d57e7b164c93", "ja": "おお……！\nこれが新しいユニットの曲、ということですか？", "zh": "哦……！\n这就是新组合的歌曲吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1028_president", "source_sha256": "f58b30944af2f1e8251854aa29ad99aed8bf08e33ffb381f3b44c154a83ba55f", "ja": "うむ！　新ユニットのための新曲だ！\nジャジーな雰囲気が素敵な楽曲だろう！", "zh": "嗯！这是为新组合准备的新曲！\n具有爵士韵味的氛围很棒吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1029_101kot", "source_sha256": "e4da1d9cdd8c40a8cac32b047d1b9ecdd5efeca44f8b0b6c35b16d6124479838", "ja": "大人っぽくて切ないメロディ……ぐっときますね！\nこの曲が似合うアイドルというと……？", "zh": "成熟中带着一丝伤感的旋律……太戳心了呢！\n要说适合这首歌的偶像，会是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1030_p", "source_sha256": "712756fe64271c15d36cd4cb124a57f3d2bdc038bd4cf8232c43bd1a83deca65", "ja": "強い意思の歌詞にも惹かれますね……。\n朋花、千鶴さん、可憐あたりが似合う気がします。", "zh": "歌词中蕴含的坚强意志也很吸引人呢……\n感觉朋花、千鹤小姐、可怜她们挺适合的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1031_101kot", "source_sha256": "c3681048b6168a5882303cc8224230ca624511e0b9b3a30d79acc742fb17982e", "ja": "あ、私も同じメンバーを想像してました！\nなぜだかあの3人が、パッと頭に浮かんで。", "zh": "啊，我也想到了同样的成员！\n不知为什么，那3个人一下子就浮现在我的脑海里了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1032_president", "source_sha256": "7633e6e80cb67a2ba2a48166057441f92188f84f7ffc21f3f123817332e0c620", "ja": "私も同じ3人を想定していたよ。\nこの歌は彼女たちの歌声でぜひ聴いてみたい！", "zh": "我也设想了同样的3个人。\n真想听听她们的歌声唱这首歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1033_p", "source_sha256": "8a95f9ee919d3670dc705b72163511a89babe2568e32e5a1cb9ff7747482bba0", "ja": "イメージが一致しましたね！　それで……。\nこのユニット、プロデュースさせていただいても？", "zh": "想法一致呢！那么……可以请您让我来制作这个组合吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1034_president", "source_sha256": "f32b5026f7aa5f7949818a9514074e3a75aead0c401ef7e0484084c4697d9485", "ja": "はっはっは。焦らずとも、君に任せる予定だよ。\nぜひとも腕前を奮ってくれたまえ！", "zh": "哈哈哈。不用着急，之后打算交给你来做。\n务必好好展现你的本领吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1035_101kot", "source_sha256": "c997ae57e15016a7345c524c68f3ca8f02126c3dadaff8cdb273cd90c24b9d84", "ja": "どんなユニットになるのか、とっても楽しみです。\nいちファンとして、期待させてもらっちゃいますね♪", "zh": "我非常期待会组成怎样的组合。\n就让我以一名粉丝的身份，好好期待一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1036_p", "source_sha256": "0664d8bc88cca88b71932e16012ece5a061eeb75e07f04eb4e7ce3f17f34727a", "ja": "（新ユニット、間違いなくいいものになるはずだ！\nでも……問題は、スケジュールだな）", "zh": "（新组合肯定会很棒！不过……问题在于日程安排啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0174_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0174_story_intro_1037_p", "source_sha256": "1b39ad5a01dbf892e80e77fbeb8ac67a8ad15f8d82391a947f16312d8ebbd23c", "ja": "（最近、3人とも忙しくなってきているから。\nどう調整するか、考えていかないとな）", "zh": "（最近，3个人也都忙起来了。接下来得想想该怎么调整才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
